  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Switches the ROMs out ($01 = $05) and stops the CIA 1 interrupts. It enables the raster IRQ, sets the IRQ, NMI and RESET vectors and arms the CIA 2 timer B NMI."},
    {"at":7,"placement":"side","text":"Stops all CIA 1 interrupt sources."},
    {"at":14,"placement":"side","text":"Enables the raster interrupt only."},
    {"at":19,"placement":"side","text":"RAM everywhere with I/O at $d000; no BASIC or KERNAL ROM."},
    {"at":31,"placement":"side","text":"RESET vector to an RTI byte. A real reset switches the ROM in, so the CPU never reads it."},
    {"at":56,"placement":"side","text":"Timer B of CIA 2 gives the NMI of the floor colour split."},
    {"at":73,"placement":"side","text":"Port A of CIA 1 as input for the joystick read."}
  ],
